=1qQLudpXK2AQ7kNvwG_nqg3&_nc_oc=AdoAIt9qj84LZqdlxkQ1CSjj0URRdbWZmYF5G3vVUALSUsZz7VwnzfBoP0hrKjUnXf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjNgQ20Q12dW2n9DPciQt2XqmvkigbJVH-aj6MkxyCCg&oe=6AF8A15A"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1320544502313929", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75278189_1320544505647262_7322829517315090882_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K7Tq9r4LKvQQ7kNvwFvIbqc&_nc_oc=AdpJHyj-7zc0xPcgmpcMzCu85ne0I88Om16OCukI3n5ZW-jLAyOiYuxHyxZzadT-Yy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_B6j63qo6zeK6IY0zYsAUvzuR5MO3PH_jwSW6RllanA&oe=6AF8997B"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1734844490691892", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974844_1734844494025225_778535308743462438_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hb8RZ1medh4Q7kNvwGU7Doj&_nc_oc=AdqUSZSJJ5CcHnGcitX31WAPbeXSTmE_tpV-VK11PWJ--Apggd15X62kfrBk9ePee9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRiTIFWVy9N8D86-tQ-JAUyCQjMq7VOvzI9pm0QKSPJRg&oe=6AF8AAC1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440_CoverLandscape (1).png", "id": "473024245842426", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982620_473024249175759_566385611604994110_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oM_mEgiowLgQ7kNvwF-QXK5&_nc_oc=AdpOQdse1HaGKy9ypAr23wptp0v7_8BMXJyfyq8qvvW3uUcKCat7UiT803hOu65iCC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSf7gvAJv7MpfOvNuj8mXhAMxD8iVWRkU-7amLhVONepg&oe=6AF8A48B"}, "display_name": "Euphoria Beats", "keywords": ["Immersive", "competitive", "Music", "Dance", "Engaging"], "long_description": "**Dance Deep Dive**\n\n**Euphoria Beats VR** is an immersive rhythm-based VR experience that invites players to express themselves through dance and movement. Designed for players of all skill levels, the game focuses on its **Casual Mode**, offering a vibrant, low-pressure environment to unwind, groove, and have fun.\n\nIn **Euphoria Beats VR**, players can explore two dynamic and visually stunning environments: \n\n- **Pub Dance Floor**: Step into a neon-lit bar, alive with energy and rhythm. Dance across a glowing, reflective floor while interactive props like vibrant lights respond to your every move. The warm golden and cyan hues create a welcoming social atmosphere where players can relax and dance to the beat.  \n   \n- **Abstract Space**: Enter a surreal, dreamlike world filled with floating geometric shapes, glowing orbs, and fluid visuals that pulse with the rhythm. The vivid magenta and cyan tones provide a creative escape, letting players lose themselves in a limitless, artistic dance experience.\n\nFrom hitting glowing rhythm points to creating trails of light with every movement, the first-person gameplay ensures total immersion. Whether you're seeking a relaxed dance session or a creative outlet, *Euphoria Beats VR* delivers a visually rich and rhythm-synced experience that celebrates the joy of music, movement, and freedom of expression.", "short_description": "Euphoria Beats VR is an immersive rhythm-based VR game that lets you dance your way through vibrant environments. Featuring Casual Mode, players can groove freely in two unique settings: the neon-lit Pub Dance Floor, exuding lively social vibes, and the surreal Abstract Space, a dreamlike world of glowing shapes and dynamic colors. With first-person gameplay and beat-synced visuals, Euphoria Beats VR offers a relaxing, expressive experience for players of all skill levels."}]}, "developer_name": "Biswa Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/privacy_policy/euphoriabeats/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Biswa Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534",